            <a class="module-card directory-card" href="/previews/curriculum/introduction/intro-classification.html"><div class="directory-card-top"><span class="module-index directory-card-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="directory-card-kicker">认识类型</span></div><strong class="module-title directory-card-title">建筑物的分类</strong><span class="module-desc directory-card-description">按使用功能、层数高度和结构体系认识建筑，练习用多个分类维度描述同一栋建筑。</span><div class="directory-card-tags"><span>功能分类</span><span>高度层数</span><span>结构体系</span></div><span class="directory-card-footer"><span>开始阅读</span><span class="directory-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
