            <a class="module-card directory-card" href="/previews/curriculum/introduction/intro-composition.html"><div class="directory-card-top"><span class="module-index directory-card-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="directory-card-kicker">整体认识</span></div><strong class="module-title directory-card-title">建筑物的构造组成</strong><span class="module-desc directory-card-description">从六类基本构件认识建筑，沿典型传力路径读懂承载、围护与交通之间的联系。</span><div class="directory-card-tags"><span>基本构件</span><span>传力路径</span><span>剖面识读</span></div><span class="directory-card-footer"><span>开始阅读</span><span class="directory-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
