            <a class="module-card directory-card" href="/previews/curriculum/basics/deformation-joint/index.html"><div class="directory-card-top"><span class="module-index directory-card-number" aria-hidden="true">07</span><span class="directory-card-kicker">给位移留空间</span></div><strong class="module-title directory-card-title">建筑变形缝</strong><span class="module-desc directory-card-description">辨别伸缩缝、沉降缝与抗震缝，理解结构分开后墙面、楼地面和屋顶怎样保持使用连续。</span><div class="directory-card-tags"><span>三类变形缝</span><span>设置条件</span><span>活动盖缝</span></div><span class="directory-card-footer"><span>浏览章节</span><span class="directory-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>
